   "summary": "A precision surface grinder for flat, parallel and square faces on dies, moulds, plates, gauges and machine parts in hardened or soft steel and other materials. The table travels on scraped V and flat guideways with Turcite-B coating, driven hydraulically at 16 – 82 ft/min (5 – 25 m/min); the cross and vertical axes run on ballscrews and AC servo motors under a Mitsubishi NC with a 10″ touchscreen, so the operator keys in the stock to remove and the down feed — in 0.00004″ (0.001 mm) steps — and the cross feed are applied stroke by stroke. A 15.7 × 31.5″ (400 × 800 mm) electromagnetic chuck on a 17.7 × 35.4″ (450 × 900 mm) table, a Ø13.8″ (350 mm) wheel on a direct-drive spindle and 21.7″ (550 mm) under the wheel centre.",
   "features": [
    "Grinds 35.4 × 17.7″ (900 × 450 mm) faces; 3.0 – 21.7″ (75 – 550 mm) from the wheel centre to the table",
    "Automatic down feed in 0.00004″ (0.001 mm) steps; automatic cross feed 0.002 – 0.79″ (0.05 – 20 mm) per stroke",
    "Mitsubishi NC on the cross and vertical axes, AC servo motors on ballscrews, 10″ touchscreen, wired handwheel",
    "Electro-hydraulic table drive; direct-drive spindle on preloaded precision bearings",
    "Stress-relieved cast base; honeycomb-ribbed column; V and flat guideways, Turcite-B coated and hand-scraped",
    "Electromagnetic chuck 15.7 × 31.5″ (400 × 800 mm) with demagnetizing unit",
    "Ø13.8″ (350 mm) wheel with flange, puller, balancing stand and arbor; table-mounted diamond dresser",
    "Coolant system with paper filter; hydraulic unit; central lubrication; table guard and door interlock",
    "CSA-approved electrical panel; transformer for 600, 480, 240 or 208 V 3-phase"
   ],
   "optional": [
    "Additional wheel flange",
    "Wheel-head-mounted diamond dresser",
    "Magnetic sine plate (V-S 100M) and sine bar (VS-100)",
    "Magnetic separator with paper filter for the coolant",
    "Precision toolmaker's vise (VMV-40)",
    "Workpiece demagnetizer (VDM-68)",
    "Profile grinding and dressing attachment (V-PB-BS)"
   ],
